?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9496? \u9492?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9496? \u9474?\par \u9474? \u8226? Incidents  \u9474?                                                         \u9474?\par \u9474? \u8226? Validation \u9474?  \u9484?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9488? \u9474?\par \u9474? \u8226? Evidence   \u9474?  \u9474? LIVE CCTV PREVIEW (640x480 @ 18.2 FPS)             \u9474? \u9474?\par \u9474? \u8226? Cameras    \u9474?  \u9474? [Person 92%] [WEAPON: KNIFE 78%]                   \u9474? \u9474?\par \u9474? \u8226? Reports    \u9474?  \u9474? -------------------------------------------------- \u9474? \u9474?\par \u9474? \u8226? Settings   \u9474?  \u9474? Current People: 2 | Unique: 5 | Latency: 18ms      \u9474? \u9474?\par \u9474?              \u9474?  \u9492?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9496? \u9474?\par \u9492?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9524?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9472?\u9496?\par \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 1. Public Landing Page ([`LandingPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 The entry point of the application delivers an authoritative presentation of system capabilities, live backend connectivity metrics (ping latency, health status, CPU acceleration), interactive architectural pipeline diagrams, a target threat matrix vs. false-positive suppression comparison, an overview of the three RBAC security clearance tiers, an engineering benchmark table, an interactive technical FAQ accordion, and direct action triggers to launch the Operator Login Console.\par \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 2. Security Operator Login Page ([`LoginPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 Provides an authenticated gateway to the surveillance console. Features one-click operator presets for rapid switching between clearance profiles during evaluation:\par \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  \i Lead Commander\i0  (\f1\fs19\cf2 admin\f0\fs22\cf1  / \f1\fs19\cf2 admin\f0\fs22\cf1  | Badge: \f1\fs19\cf2 CMD-9041\f0\fs22\cf1 ): Full administrative authority.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  \i Forensic Analyst\i0  (\f1\fs19\cf2 analyst\f0\fs22\cf1  / \f1\fs19\cf2 analyst\f0\fs22\cf1  | Badge: \f1\fs19\cf2 ANL-4208\f0\fs22\cf1 ): Investigative and evidence review clearance.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  \i Field Operator\i0  (\f1\fs19\cf2 operator\f0\fs22\cf1  / \f1\fs19\cf2 operator\f0\fs22\cf1  | Badge: \f1\fs19\cf2 OPS-1192\f0\fs22\cf1 ): Live stream monitoring clearance.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 3. Command Overview Dashboard ([`Overview.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/Overview.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 The operational nerve center. Displays high-level telemetry KPI cards: Active Cameras Count, Active Video Jobs Processing, Unreviewed Incidents Awaiting Triage, and SQLite WAL Database Status. Features hardware telemetry progress bars showing real-time host CPU utilization percentage, physical and logical core counts, RAM memory usage in megabytes, and available free disk space on the primary storage volume.\par \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 4. Live CCTV Surveillance & Monitoring ([`LiveMonitoring.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/LiveMonitoring.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 Renders responsive video grid viewports displaying live camera streams via HTTP MJPEG. Overlaid upon each active video stream are real-time telemetry pills:\par \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  Live FPS Counter (dynamically computed from incoming frames).\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  Stream Resolution (e.g., $640 \\times 480$ / $1920 \\times 1080$).\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  AI Inference Latency in milliseconds (e.g., \f1\fs19\cf2 AI: 18ms\f0\fs22\cf1 ).\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  Real-time bounding boxes around detected persons with confidence labels.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  Pulsing red alert banners when weapons are detected in the active frame.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  Stream drop detection overlay providing one-click "Reconnect Stream" and "Restart Feed" controls.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  Telemetry footer metrics: Current People visible, Cumulative Unique People tracked, and Total Processed AI frames.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 5. Video Analysis & Safety Audit ([`VideoAnalysis.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/VideoAnalysis.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 A forensic batch processing suite. Allows operators to drag-and-drop surveillance recordings (MP4, AVI, MOV) for background CPU processing. Features a prominent \b AI Surveillance Verdict Banner\b0  classifying footage as either \f1\fs19\cf2 NORMAL ACTIVITY\f0\fs22\cf1  (green badge) or \f1\fs19\cf2 SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY DETECTED\f0\fs22\cf1  (red pulsing badge). Evaluates five core safety vectors:\par \pard\li360\sa120\b 1.\b0  Weapon & Threat Object Scan.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 2.\b0  Violent Physical Altercation Analysis.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 3.\b0  Rapid Velocity & Motion Acceleration Spikes.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 4.\b0  Posture Instability & Fall Detection.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 5.\b0  High Crowd Occupancy Density.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 6. Incident Center & Evidence Triage ([`IncidentCenter.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/IncidentCenter.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 The human-in-the-loop review station. Displays an interactive table of all logged security events. Operators can filter incidents by Status (\f1\fs19\cf2 Potential\f0\fs22\cf1 , \f1\fs19\cf2 Acknowledged\f0\fs22\cf1 , \f1\fs19\cf2 Reviewed\f0\fs22\cf1 , \f1\fs19\cf2 Dismissed\f0\fs22\cf1 ), Threat Category (\f1\fs19\cf2 Weapon\f0\fs22\cf1 , \f1\fs19\cf2 Altercation\f0\fs22\cf1 , \f1\fs19\cf2 Intrusion\f0\fs22\cf1 ), and Source Camera. Selecting an incident opens an interactive evidence modal playing the extracted 6.0-second MP4 clip with full playback controls, accompanied by metadata (camera name, exact timestamp, detection confidence, reviewer notes) and triage action buttons (\f1\fs19\cf2 Acknowledge\f0\fs22\cf1 , \f1\fs19\cf2 Mark Reviewed\f0\fs22\cf1 , \f1\fs19\cf2 False Positive\f0\fs22\cf1 ).\par \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 7. Weapon Validation & Reliability Dashboard ([`WeaponValidationDashboard.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/WeaponValidationDashboard.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 An empirical verification console. Displays real database-derived statistics: Total Weapon Events Logged, Events Awaiting Human Review, Confirmed Events, False Positive Events, and Weapon Class Breakdown (Guns vs. Knives). Provides an Evidence File Integrity Audit checking whether referenced MP4 clips and thumbnails physically exist on disk, alongside model latency distributions.\par \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 8. Camera Management Console ([`CameraManagement.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/CameraManagement.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 Enables discovery and configuration of surveillance endpoints. Features tabbed source configuration for Laptop Webcams (Index 0), IP CCTV Cameras (RTSP), DVR/NVR Channels, and Android Phone streams. Includes one-click vendor presets for Hikvision, Dahua, Reolink, and Axis cameras, a live "Test Stream Connection" probe, and connection health indicators.\par \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 9. Auditable Security Reports ([`Reports.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/Reports.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 An enterprise compliance reporting engine. Features configurable timeframe filters (All Time, 24 Hours, 7 Days, 30 Days), KPI summaries (Total Incidents in Scope, Confirmed Threats, Pending Triage, False Positives, Average Confidence), one-click \b Export CSV\b0  for spreadsheet analysis, \b Export JSON\b0  for SIEM ingestion, and a browser-optimized \b Print Report\b0  layout for physical security briefings.\par \pard\sa160\sb100\f0\fs22\b\cf4 10. System Governance & RBAC Console ([`Settings.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/sadik/Documents/antigravity/adventurous-raman/frontend/src/pages/Settings.tsx))\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 Provides two specialized administrative consoles:\par \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  \i Inference Tuning\i0 : Sliders for CPU Sampling Rate (1\u8211?20 FPS), Person Detection Confidence (10%\u8211?90%), Weapon Confidence (15%\u8211?90%), Consecutive Confirmation Frames (1\u8211?6 frames), and Cooldown Windows (3\u8211?60s).\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\bullet  \i Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\i0 : An interactive policy matrix table enabling the Lead Commander to toggle individual operational permissions across Analyst and Operator roles with instant real-time synchronization.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\sa160\sb160\cf4 _____________________________________________________________________\cf1\par\sa200 \pard\sa240\sb180\f0\fs28\b\cf2 08 TESTING\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sb140\f0\fs24\b\cf3 8.1 Purpose\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 The purpose of the verification suite is to ensure that the CCTV AI Surveillance System satisfies all functional, performance, security, and stability requirements. Testing validates that the asynchronous FastAPI backend, multi-threaded camera capture workers, YOLOv8n CPU inference engine, temporal confirmation gates, evidence buffering routines, and React frontend operate without deadlocks, memory leaks, or unhandled exceptions under demanding real-time conditions.\par \pard\sa160\sb160\cf4 _____________________________________________________________________\cf1\par\sa200 \pard\sa200\sb140\f0\fs24\b\cf3 8.2 Testing Types\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\li360\sa120\b 1.\b0  \b Unit Testing\b0 : Validates isolated software units\u8212?such as password masking utility functions, bounding-box coordinate transformers, circular deque buffer boundaries, and mathematical confidence threshold validators.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 2.\b0  \b Integration Testing\b0 : Verifies communication between interconnected subsystems\u8212?including camera stream creation through REST endpoints, video job queuing to background workers, SQLite database state updates via SQLAlchemy, and evidence file writes to disk.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 3.\b0  \b End-to-End (E2E) API Testing\b0 : Simulates complete client workflows using \f1\fs19\cf2 httpx.AsyncClient\f0\fs22\cf1 , validating HTTP status codes, JSON payload schemas, multipart MJPEG video streams, and error handling.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 4.\b0  \b Performance & Concurrency Testing\b0 : Evaluates system behavior under multi-camera load, verifying CPU thread synchronization, non-blocking SQLite WAL writes, and memory stability during continuous ring buffer operation.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\li360\sa120\b 5.\b0  \b Clearance & RBAC Security Testing\b0 : Verifies that restricted API endpoints and UI views enforce permission boundaries, preventing unauthorized analysts or operators from modifying system configurations.\par\pard\sa200 \pard\sa160\sb160\cf4 _____________________________________________________________________\cf1\par\sa200 \pard\sa200\sb140\f0\fs24\b\cf3 8.3 Test Cases\b0\par\sa200\fs22\cf1 \pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 The automated backend test suite comprises \b 63 comprehensive test cases\b0  executed via \f1\fs19\cf2 pytest\f0\fs22\cf1  and \f1\fs19\cf2 pytest-asyncio\f0\fs22\cf1 . All 63 tests pass with 100% success rate:\par \pard\li360\ri360\f1\fs18\cf2\sa100 ============================= test session starts =============================\par platform win32 -- Python 3.11.15, pytest-9.1.1, pluggy-1.7.0\par rootdir: backend, configfile: pytest.ini\par collected 63 items\par \par backend/tests/test_cameras.py .............                              [ 20%]\par backend/tests/test_database.py .                                         [ 22%]\par backend/tests/test_detection_and_incidents.py ........                   [ 34%]\par backend/tests/test_health.p